sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant CLI as odh-cli<br/>(rhai-cli)
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant TrustyAI as TrustyAI Service<br/>443/TCP HTTPS Route
    participant GitHub as odh-gitops<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over User,K8s: Flow 1: Lint / Upgrade Readiness Assessment
        User->>CLI: kubectl odh lint --target-version=3.5
        CLI->>K8s: GET DataScienceCluster, DSCInitialization<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
        K8s-->>CLI: Cluster state
        CLI->>K8s: GET OLM Subscriptions, CSVs<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
        K8s-->>CLI: Operator state
        CLI->>K8s: LIST Notebooks, InferenceServices,<br/>RayClusters, DSPAs, etc.<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
        K8s-->>CLI: Workload resources
        CLI->>CLI: Execute 50+ checks<br/>(Dependency→Service→Platform→<br/>Component→Workload)
        CLI-->>User: Results table/JSON/YAML<br/>Exit codes: 0-5
    end

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note over User,TrustyAI: Flow 2: Migration Execution
        User->>CLI: kubectl odh migrate run --phase=pre-upgrade
        CLI->>K8s: GET workload state<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
        K8s-->>CLI: Current state
        CLI->>K8s: CREATE temp ServiceAccount, Role, RoleBinding<br/>(owner references for cleanup)
        K8s-->>CLI: Created
        CLI->>K8s: PATCH Notebooks (auth model migration)<br/>PATCH InferenceServices (accelerator migration)<br/>PATCH DSPAs, ConfigMaps<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
        K8s-->>CLI: Patched
        CLI->>TrustyAI: GET /metrics/group/fairness/spd/request<br/>Auth: Bearer Token<br/>TLS 1.2 (InsecureSkipVerify)
        TrustyAI-->>CLI: Metrics definitions (backup)
        CLI->>TrustyAI: POST /metrics/group/fairness/spd/request<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        TrustyAI-->>CLI: Metrics restored
        CLI-->>User: Migration results (JSON/YAML)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 249, 196)
        Note over User,K8s: Flow 3: MCP Server Integration
        participant Agent as AI Agent
        Agent->>CLI: JSON-RPC tool invocation<br/>(stdio or SSE/8080)
        CLI->>CLI: Clone ConfigFlags<br/>(auth, certs, impersonation)
        CLI->>K8s: Execute command pipeline<br/>Auth: cloned kubeconfig
        K8s-->>CLI: Results
        CLI-->>Agent: JSON-RPC response
    end
